WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:25.510
Noa, you pretend to be a creator to justify your pitiful past.

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.450
But you'll never surpass me!

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:34.200
Even if your Deck Master is powerful and invincible, I will surpass it!

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.670
I'll end your farce.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.300
I'll finish this duel.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.700
What?  Mokuba?

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.580
You're standing in my way?

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:49.590
Save Mokuba!
7th Turn of Destiny

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.130
Mokuba...

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:09.510
By sealing his painful memories, he's forgotten about you.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:13.210
My brother's enemy is my enemy.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.380
Mokuba.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.780
What's wrong, Seto?

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.380
Aren't you going to attack?

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:23.020
Due to Dragon's Rage's effect, I'll lose all my life points if you attack.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.460
But can Mokuba survive the damage?

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:28.660
How dare you...

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.660
Damn that guy!

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.330
Seto, hurry up and attack.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:40.220
Noa hasn't shown any weakness so far.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.840
Kaiba won't win if he lets this chance go.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.600
But still...

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.700
Mokuba...

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:52.020
I end my turn.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.680
Kaiba.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.120
That's right.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.360
Just as I expected.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:07.630
A pathetic future awaits you.  Your body will be offered to me.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.660
Mokuba, well done.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.340
Come here.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.380
My brother, watch him fall.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.010
Yes, brother.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.510
My turn.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.380
The 4th turn of creation.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:29.320
My Deck Master, Shinato's Ark, activates its third ability.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.260
Third ability?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:37.900
Yes.  Shinato's Ark's third ability is Life Restoration!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.300
The monsters in the ark...

00:03:52.940 --> 00:04:04.660
For every monster I banish from Shinato's Ark, Life Restoration restores 500 life points.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:09.370
There are 12 monsters inside the ark.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:13.000
So I regain 6000 life points.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.010
Noa has 6400 life points!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:27.340
He didn't use Life Restoration until now...

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:32.020
...because he wanted to use Mokuba as a shield and torment Kaiba.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:33.450
That punk!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.990
I activate the spell card, Dark Hole!

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:41.560
It destroys all monsters on the field.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:55.230
More monsters went inside the ark.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:58.910
Absolute Defense's infinite loop and Life Restoration...

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.910
His Deck Master is invincible!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.350
This duel isn't even close.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.780
I end my turn.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.350
What's wrong, Seto?

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.790
It's your turn.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:16.360
Mokuba, I swore to be your father and protect you.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:20.570
I know I was cold-hearted to you.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:25.840
Only because I wanted to make sure at least you could stay in the Kaiba family.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.470
Throw him out!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.470
I wasn't using you.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.410
I'll give you my cards.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:41.220
Only we understood this strategy.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.650
Our bond defeated a monster named Gozaburo.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:48.570
It was the only way to save us.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:54.260
Mokuba.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:58.680
There must be a way to save you.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.020
Kaiba!  Trust Mokuba!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.080
Yugi!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:07.480
Marik forced Jonouchi and I to fight each other.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:11.980
It was our bond that allowed us to escape!

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.670
Keep fighting.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:18.140
Fight and restore your bond with Mokuba!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.420
Our bond...

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:25.360
I do have a card that proves my bond with Mokuba!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.530
Your friend gives good advice.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.260
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.350
I don't obey other people's orders.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.260
I fight with my own free will!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.970
My turn!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:39.880
This isn't it.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:44.240
Return from another dimension, Different Dimension Dragon!

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:49.250
I switch Different Dimension Dragon to defense position.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.690
I end my turn.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.120
The 5th turn of creation.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.870
The field changed again.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:11.800
Land creatures have evolved rapidly.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.980
The dawn of modern civilization.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.620
Look, brother!

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:21.720
That's...

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.890
Kaiba Corporation.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:28.540
Yes.  Kaiba Corporation is supposed to be my castle.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.140
We have reached modern times.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:37.500
Seto, I'll show you how wonderful Kaiba Corporation's weapons are.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.540
Gradius!  Launch!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.790
The spell card, Cyclon Laser!

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:11.920
I equip the spell card, Matter Leveler.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:24.180
Due to Matter Leveler, my monster will have 100 more attack points than yours when I attack.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:29.820
And Cyclon Laser lets my monster deal piercing damage.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.900
My target is Different Dimension Dragon!

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.060
Cyclon Laser!  Fire!

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:50.110
Different Dimension Dragon can't be destroyed by spells or battling.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:54.380
It's the perfect monster to torture you.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:09:00.750
Noa is going to torture Kaiba to death!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.120
Kaiba!  Do something!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.220
Kaiba...

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.300
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.660
This isn't the card I need!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.600
I leave Different Dimension Dragon in defense position and end my turn!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:18.300
Because there's nothing you can do.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.540
Keep suffering, Seto.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.470
Every time I see you in agony, it makes me happy.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:29.680
It's disgraceful that you want others to suffer as you have.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:32.910
And you call yourself a creator?  Lame.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.590
No wonder Gozaburo gave up on you.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.660
Be quiet, Seto!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:41.020
My father trusts me!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.440
I worked hard for my father.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.700
I've never failed to meet his expectations!

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.950
I'll resurrect as a human while keeping my intelligence!

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:56.140
And I will build the Kaiba Empire that my father failed to finish!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:59.140
My father will be happy for me!

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.050
He'll say that I'm his one and only son!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.900
The 6th turn of creation.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.520
I summon Gradius' Option!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:17.190
Gradius' Option has the same abilities as Gradius.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.630
Gradius' Option, transform into Gradius!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.400
Cyclon Laser, fire!

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:40.660
Mokuba, look closely at our enemy.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:42.820
Mokuba...

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:46.050
Seto, this must be agonizing.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:49.060
To be betrayed by the one you love.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:54.660
My monster can still attack.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.500
Go, Gradius!

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.500
Cyclon Laser, fire!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.370
Serves you right, Seto!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.310
Noa!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.740
Get up, Kaiba!  Don't give up!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.560
Silence, fool!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.920
You're not allowed to order me around!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.760
Kaiba!  You punk!

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:51.590
Brother!

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.000
Fighting among friends?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.220
That's a fatal symptom of weak-hearted humans.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:02.800
Seto, losing in despair suits you.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:04.920
Don't you agree, Mokuba?

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:09.940
Mokuba!  You're fine with Kaiba's suffering?

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:14.400
I thought you and Kaiba always helped each other!

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.610
I thought your bond was unbreakable!

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.660
What?  The seal is breaking?

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:24.780
Mokuba.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.720
This will probably be my last turn.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.340
I can't fight you.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:36.930
As long as you're with me, I can always keep fighting.

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:41.100
That won't change, now and forever!

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:45.240
Mokuba!  Recall a memory!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:51.180
What the Kaiba family adopted us, our lives were hell.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:54.600
My spirit almost broke many times.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.950
But the cards you gave me...

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:01.250
All these weak cards.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.370
That card saved me.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:12.600
When I saw the card you made, I vowed that I'll get the real version someday.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.080
To become a man worthy of having that card!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.200
Big brother...

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:46.000
Without that card, I wouldn't have survived.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:51.810
Have I become a man - a brother - worthy of that card?

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.980
My turn!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.620
My deck, guide me and Mokuba!

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:10.240
I set a card!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.700
I activate Kaiser Sea Horse's Deck Master ability!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.620
I tribute Different Dimension Dragon!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.580
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.080
Blue-Eyes!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.170
Big brother...

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.100
Mokuba!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.900
Big brother!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.660
Why am I...

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.680
He regained his memories.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.440
Mokuba!  Get away from him!

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.850
He was controlling you!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.060
Noa!  How dare you!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.180
Now, Kaiba!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:17.060
Take this, Noa!  Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:29.660
Hooray!  Noa lost life points!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:34.040
When Gradius is destroyed, Gradius' Option is also destroyed!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:37.730
Seto, I congratulate you for damaging me.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:39.800
But I am invincible!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.480
Shinato's Ark!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.660
Life Restoration!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.520
Damn!

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.230
Noa gained life points again!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.230
This will be your last, Seto!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:57.460
My turn!

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:04.630
I was waiting for this moment, Noa.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:08.070
It's time to settle things for real.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.010
What?

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.440
Who will win, you or me?

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.030
This will settle it!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.900
I activate my trap card!

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.950
Last Turn!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:21.550
What?

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:33.540
Due to Last Turn, I select one monster on my field.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:38.100
All other cards on our fields and in our hands are discarded!

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:43.780
Then you summon one monster from your deck and battle!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:47.110
Last Turn ignores their life points!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.120
Whoever wins this battle will win the duel!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.400
This is all or nothing!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.050
Kaiba is taking a huge gamble!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.360
Of course, I choose...

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.740
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:04.140
I choose my Deck Master, Shinato's Ark!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:10.770
Noa!  Me and Mokuba's anger will strike you!

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:14.510
Go, Blue-Eyes!  For our future!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:18.210
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.480
All right!

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.030
Just kidding.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.370
What?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.240
What's that?

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:52.660
That's not good enough to defeat me.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.350
Vanish, Seto!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:07.780
Big brother!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:17.270
Seto, did you forget that this is the 7th turn of creation?

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:23.350
It's the turn that my Deck Master, Shinato's Ark, activates its final special ability!

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:26.640
This is my Deck Master's true form!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.550
Shinato, King of a Higher Plane!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:33.020
The creator and god of everything!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.050
Noa's body is...

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.400
This is my true self.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.960
Due to Last Turn, we don't lose life points.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:47.300
But the battle decides the duel.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.460
Seto, it's over!

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.640
Father, did you watch?

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:57.110
I proved that I'm superior to Seto!

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:59.600
Big brother!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.210
I'm sorry!  It's my fault!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.880
Mokuba.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.570
Seto!  Mokuba!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.820
I deal you divine punishment!

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.030
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.370
Mokuba!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:17.970
Mokuba!

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.600
This is great.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:23.640
They can almost touch, but they won't forever.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:28.570
I name it "Beautiful Brotherly Love."

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.540
Kaiba.  Mokuba.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:43.490
How dare you toy with Kaiba's life and use Mokuba as a shield!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.490
Have you no heart?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:51.430
It all went according to plan to achieve my perfect victory.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.340
Perfect victory?

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:57.440
You're the one who actually lost this duel!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.600
What?

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:03.440
Kaiba still had Different Dimension Dragon this turn.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:06.380
That monster can't be destroyed in battle.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:12.820
If Kaiba didn't summon Blue-Eyes, Last Turn would've ended in a tie.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:19.760
Kaiba chose not to do so and summoned Blue-Eyes to get Mokuba back to normal!

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:24.430
Noa!  You could've never done that because you're selfish!

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:31.200
You think you can run Kaiba Corporation when you can't even connect with a single person?

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.400
Don't make me laugh!

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.870
How dare you!

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:39.320
Kaiba still has a few life points left.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:43.140
If you want to be the true winner, duel me!

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.650
You're going to take Kaiba's place?

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:53.090
I'm inheriting Kaiba's deck, his fighting spirit and Mokuba's sadness!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.260
Fine.

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.930
That's crazy, Yugi!

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:59.740
He has 7400 life points!  You have 400!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.740
And no cards in your hand!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.430
One attack will defeat you!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:08.360
As you wish, I'll end you too, Yugi Muto!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.080
Don't do this, Yugi!

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.380
Yugi!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.210
Noa!

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:31.900
For Kaiba and Mokuba, I won't forgive you for being cold-hearted!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:37.200
Duel!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:53.540
Using Kaiba's deck and his few life points, Yugi challenges Noa to a duel.

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:59.620
Noa rebuilds his deck and uses unknown Spirit Monsters to attack Yugi.

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:03.260
Yugi struggles against their new effects.

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:06.580
Yugi barely has any life points or cards, but please survive!

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.780
A chance will present itself!

00:22:08.780 --> 00:22:12.500
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Inherited Deck
Yugi vs Noa

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:13.980
Duel, standby!

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:25.420
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:34.370
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:39.340
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:43.310
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:51.280
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:54.850
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:59.620
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:09.730
And walk it without stopping

00:23:09.730 --> 00:23:17.340
